      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KING DOUGIE (8) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at his last five runs. Last start finished 2nd over 400m at this track beaten 4.5 lengths (22.69) behind Baggy Trousers in a Grade 4/5 on October 6. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Can measure up this time. DESI'S DREAM (7) found the frame for the second consecutive time when narrowly beaten into second last time out (19.04) over 340m at this track. Well placed here and should do much better. HEY BUBBA LOUIE (1) ran below best last time finishing fourth (23.29) over 400m at this track from Box 4. Has good early burn and is suited drawn on the inside. Can measure up this time. TRALAERO (2) can find the frame without surprising.",
